# J0: the four-card status, an all-four reset with the heal, and the fabric probe
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the TP4 bring-up (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env, commit, and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig,
# a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# Duration (estimate, wall clock; the workflow's step limits in parentheses): status 1 min; reset 3-12 min, heal to 3 min more (step 30); fabric 8-25 min: the mesh open, the ring, then 16 collectives timed (step 45). About 30-40 min in all.
# Answers first: do all four boards enumerate, is the ring OK (2 links per edge), is tt_ccl at 2 links, are the collectives exact, at what GB/s. The image is only the runtime the probe runs in (any image with ttnn).
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status reset fabric
C2_IMAGE_TAG=s2-6a10e85
C2_PROFILE=general-tp4
C2_FABRIC=FABRIC_1D
